  // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  // Stock Market: the full list with what you can buy at 15 NP marked (cheapest first, if you like) and a Buy beside each that fills in
  // Neopets' buy form (the ticker, 1,000 shares, what that costs); your portfolio with each company at your selling price marked, what
  // each has made in NP, every company's shares opened at once, and an "All" by each lot that fills its sell box. Neopets' own buttons
  // do the buying and selling: nothing is ever bought or sold from here
  // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  // ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
